// hex_place — place, seat and combine — the operations a model survives.
//
// A body carries a POSE and is never stamped into the world lattice; two stencils are combined
// by "mark all, then cut once", which is order-free and fuses their shared edge; and a stencil
// is SEATED on terrain by writing the height slot alone, so its footprint is untouched.
//
// Entry point: re-exports `hexframe`, `hexseat`, `hexcombine`.
use hexframe;
use hexseat;
use hexcombine;
